@startuml
title Fantasy Wallpaper Studio: native delegation and pair generation
start
:Resolve request, concept set, and available host tools;
if (Required tools available?) then (yes)
  if (New ideas requested?) then (yes)
    :Delegate bounded idea categories to native subagents;
    :Collect and present ideas;
    :Resolve selected concept;
  endif
  :Delegate continuity brief and compositions to art director;
  :Main agent generates and inspects vivo portrait;
  :Main agent supplies actual portrait as image reference;
  :Main agent generates separate iPad landscape;
  :Delegate visual review when images are accessible;
  :Main agent resolves defects and verifies outputs;
  :Deliver two labeled images and verification status;
else (no)
  :Report blocked capability and available alternatives;
endif
stop
@enduml
